{
    "background_story": "Azalea was a brilliant and resourceful engineer who spent her career working on innovative solutions for sustainable refrigeration. Growing up in a small town plagued by frequent power outages, she saw firsthand the impact of spoiled food and medication on her community. Determined to make a difference, Azalea dedicated herself to finding alternatives to traditional cooling methods. Her breakthrough came when she developed a revolutionary new refrigerant that replaced toxic freon with a natural, eco-friendly compound. The discovery earned her international recognition and sparked a global shift towards greener cooling technologies. Azalea's work improved the lives of millions, and her name became synonymous with ingenuity and environmental stewardship.",
